# Claude Commands Bridge (Antigravity Meta-Skill)

This skill bridges the command workflows natively available in `.claude/commands/` so they can be executed by Antigravity and Gemini.

## Available Commands

When the user asks to run any of these commands, you must read the corresponding file in `.claude/commands/` and execute its instructions exactly as specified.

- **`/eot`** or **`/end-of-transmission`**: Read and execute `.claude/commands/eot.md` (or `.claude/commands/end-of-transmission.md`). This triggers the End-of-Session Reflection Mode.
- **`/reflect`**: Read and execute `.claude/commands/reflect.md`.
- **`/sharingan`**: Read and execute `.claude/commands/sharingan.md`.
- **`/local-subagent`**: Read and execute `.claude/commands/local-subagent.md`.

## Execution Directive

Do not attempt to guess what these commands do. You MUST read the `.claude/commands/<command>.md` file to obtain the exact steps and execute them.
